      "choice_key": "D",
      "choice_text": "The strands store different sequence information because their base orders differ; pairing identical bases determines each complementary sequence.",
      "is_correct": false,
      "rationale": "Identical-base pairing trap: Complementary DNA bases are not identical; A pairs with T, and C pairs with G. Fix: Write the partner base beneath each original base using A–T and C–G pairs."
     }
    ]
